Supplement Shopping Guide & Labels
Vitamin C: Look for Pure Ascorbic Acid + Bioflavonoids (NOW C-1000) OR Buffered/Calcium Ascorbate if stomach is sensitive (NOW AlphaSorb-C).
Vitamin E: MUST say 'Natural' or 'd-alpha-tocopherol' (avoid 'dl-'). Buy liquid softgels (NOW Natural E-400 or Nature Made Natural).
Magnesium Day: Magnesium Malate for daytime cellular energy (NOW Malate).
Magnesium Night: Magnesium Glycinate/Bisglycinate for sleep and relaxation (NOW Bisglycinate).


Amazon Shopping & Label Guide
Vitamin C (Skin Radiance & Collagen)
What to check for on the label: Look for Pure Ascorbic Acid + Bioflavonoids (excellent for absorption). If you have a sensitive stomach or history of acid reflux, look for Buffered C or Calcium Ascorbate.
Recommended Presentation: Capsules or Veg Caps.
Accessible Brands: NOW Foods Vitamin C-1000 or NOW AlphaSorb-C.

Vitamin E (The Antioxidant Partner)
What to check for on the label: MUST say "Natural" or start with the prefix d- (e.g., d-alpha-tocopherol). Completely avoid the prefix dl- (which is synthetic).
Recommended Presentation: Liquid Softgels (vital for absorbing the oil).
Accessible Brands: NOW Foods Natural E-400 or Nature Made Natural Vitamin E (USP Verified).

Magnesium (Daytime Energy)
What to check for on the label: Magnesium Malate. Avoid formulas padded out with Magnesium Oxide.
Accessible Brands: NOW Foods Magnesium Malate.

Magnesium (Nighttime Sleep & Relaxation)
What to check for on the label: Magnesium Glycinate (sometimes written as Bisglycinate).
Accessible Brands: NOW Foods Magnesium Bisglycinate.
